description	"Guri

A state-of-the-art Human Replica Droid programmed for lethal, unarmed combat.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 100% More Damage
-- 10% Faster Swings
-- Cripples/Tracks
-- 100 Flat Knockback
- Concealed Hold-Out Blaster (1)
-- 50% Less Damage/FP Drain
-- 20% Slower RoF
-- Low Ammo, Mag Reload
-- Tracks targets on hit

^8Attributes:
- Magnetic Plating
- Blast Armor
- 10% Less KB Taken
- Melee Resist
- Ally Stat Viewer
- Strength (1)
- Passive Auto-Repair (Healing 1)
- Cortosis (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Battery Recharge (3)
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Enhanced Senses (Miraluka Sense 1)
- Mind Trick Immunity (Anti-MT 2)
- Slow Faller
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Aerial Battery Regen
- Knockdown Roll
- 20% Faster Hack Speed
- 50% Faster Cooldowns
- Dexterity (3)
- Force Sense Immunity

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Flipkick (2) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Disguise (1) ^3[Style Swap In MELEE]
- Dash Jump (2) ^3[CS2]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Gunkick (3) ^3[CS4]"